{"4562800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frontier Wars: Online", "steam_appid": 4562800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVELY MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a persistent massively multiplayer world populated by various AI factions and NPCs. Frontier Wars: Online strives to be an old-school MMORPG that encourages player interaction and teamwork above all else. Work together in order to take down challenging AI foes and tackle difficult faction quests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/a48984eeb87eb64f8e868db525a980e3.avif?t=1787773244\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras_big/a48984eeb87eb64f8e868db525a980e3.avif?t=1787773244 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CHALLENGING AND DYNAMIC WORLD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compared to traditional MMORPG's, enemy mobs present a much tougher challenge in Frontier Wars: Online. Enemy mobs work together in order to accomplish higher level objectives on the world map. Every faction retains an active history of enemies and allies based on the events in the server. Enemy mobs can signal allies to attack certain individuals or areas depending on the level of threat they generate. Exploit these systems to make tactical decisions that shape the outcome of the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/2cf4ce4fe8d6a7e1a625fdb24f5a25c7.avif?t=1787773244\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL RPG COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in tactical turn-based battles where strategy and positioning is more important than fast reflexes! Featuring a hybrid turn-based + real-time system where participants can drop in and out of turn-based battle depending on certain conditions being met. A unique twist on a classic system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize your character however you like.  You can customize your characters appearance, armor, skills, and stats. Every time you level up you gain skill points and attribute points to allocate how you see fit. Unique skills may also be obtained as rare drops from boss enemies. Experiment with different armor and ability combinations.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OLD-SCHOOL ISOMETRIC ART-STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming 2.5D art-style heavily influenced by old-school fantasy CRPGs. This MMORPG supports low system and network requirements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVELY MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a persistent massively multiplayer world populated by various AI factions and NPCs. Frontier Wars: Online strives to be an old-school MMORPG that encourages player interaction and teamwork above all else. Work together in order to take down challenging AI foes and tackle difficult faction quests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/a48984eeb87eb64f8e868db525a980e3.avif?t=1787773244\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras_big/a48984eeb87eb64f8e868db525a980e3.avif?t=1787773244 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CHALLENGING AND DYNAMIC WORLD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compared to traditional MMORPG's, enemy mobs present a much tougher challenge in Frontier Wars: Online. Enemy mobs work together in order to accomplish higher level objectives on the world map. Every faction retains an active history of enemies and allies based on the events in the server. Enemy mobs can signal allies to attack certain individuals or areas depending on the level of threat they generate. Exploit these systems to make tactical decisions that shape the outcome of the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/2cf4ce4fe8d6a7e1a625fdb24f5a25c7.avif?t=1787773244\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL RPG COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in tactical turn-based battles where strategy and positioning is more important than fast reflexes! Featuring a hybrid turn-based + real-time system where participants can drop in and out of turn-based battle depending on certain conditions being met. A unique twist on a classic system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/e77848054041cec2bce2e1494464ff9f.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize your character however you like.  You can customize your characters appearance, armor, skills, and stats. Every time you level up you gain skill points and attribute points to allocate how you see fit. Unique skills may also be obtained as rare drops from boss enemies. Experiment with different armor and ability combinations.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/967fcaab5bc57b710556eadd3bccd860.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OLD-SCHOOL ISOMETRIC ART-STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming 2.5D art-style heavily influenced by old-school fantasy CRPGs. This MMORPG supports low system and network requirements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.poster.avif?t=1787773244\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.webm?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562800/extras/7b0eb948fe7149d41366d4a8e32d1417.mp4?t=1787773244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An old-school MMORPG featuring multiple NPC factions vying for control over territory. Explore the chaotic frontier of Zagros and fight in tactical turn-based battles with other players and NPC allies. Build your own character and fight against enemy factions to gain loot, EXP, and power.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/